```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> active: first capture-worthy event<br/>OnEvent → _start_locked

    active --> active: subsequent events<br/>last_event_time advanced<br/>recent_switches updated

    active --> ended: hard cut (idle > gap_minutes)
    active --> ended: soft cut (single-app focus<br/>+ NOT frequent-switching)
    active --> ended: timeout (> max_session_hours)
    active --> ended: force_end (shutdown / 23:55 safety net)

    state "ended (v1 terminal)" as ended
    ended --> [*]: emit ctxt.ambient.session.closed<br/>PUT /api/v1/sessions/{id}

    note right of ended
        Phase 6+ (deferred): ended → reduced
        when per-session reducer ships.
        Schema already carries flush_end +
        classified_end bookmarks for it.
    end note
```
